---
title: Hot Holiday Punch
author: Judy White
category: Drinks
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@cranberry juice{1.25%qt}
@brown sugar{1/4%c}
@whole cloves{1.5%tsp}
@apple juice{2%qts}
@salt{1/2%tsp}
@cinnamon sticks{4}

Stir mixture until the sugar dissolves. Add 4 cinnamon sticks, 1 1/2 tsp whole cloves and simmer for 1 hour. (Tie cinnamon sticks and cloves in cheesecloth). After one hour, remove the spice bag and serve warm.
